flowchart TB
  subgraph GEN[任务生成]
    direction LR
    Q[QUEUED] -->|领取| R[RUNNING]
    Q -->|取消| C[CANCELLED]
    Q -->|重启| F[FAILED]
    R -->|正常结束并提交| S[SUCCEEDED]
    R -->|超时 超限 错误 重启| F
    R -->|提交前取消| C
  end
  subgraph MAIL[邮件投递]
    direction LR
    P[PENDING] -->|领取| W[SENDING]
    P -->|取消| X[DELIVERY_CANCELLED]
    W -->|明确接受| T[SENT]
    W -->|明确未接受| E[DELIVERY_FAILED]
    W -->|超时或重启| U[UNKNOWN]
    E -->|有限重试| W
    U -->|用户明确重试| W
    U -->|取消| X
    E -->|取消| X
  end
